  Field names and types come from the real migrations and models.
  The repository only ships UserFactory and AdminSeeder, so every value except the
  seeded admin row is illustrative, but consistent with the engine rules:
  minimum step Rs. 500 at ~Rs. 30,000, first bid >= starting_bid + step,
  proxy resolution p* = min(m1, m2 + step), 10% deposit, anti-sniping window 15 s.
end note

